  "additionalCorrections": [
    "Malformed/truncated JPEG metadata returns an unusable optional image instead of leaking decoder RangeError.",
    "Malformed FB2 fragment escapes do not discard the readable book.",
    "PDF automatic resizing cannot cancel or overwrite a later destination; layout flags settle even on failure.",
    "Paginator cleanup after initial loading failure preserves the original opening error.",
    "Text search handles exact end boundaries, overlapping matches, empty queries, whole words split by markup, combining graphemes and Unicode lowercase length changes.",
    "Warm FB2/comic cache reuse rechecks that the original stayed unchanged during resource validation.",
    "Vendored-file modification inventory and all 218 pinned content digests are updated and verified.",
    "Malformed optional EPUB NAV/NCX destinations are isolated from required first-page loading and other valid outline entries."
  ],
